  "notes": [
    "The CSV is byte-for-byte unchanged from the pinned upstream Git blob. Values and risk ratings are published outputs, not calculations by PG Maps.",
    "The upstream README omits the CSV's 1971-2000 historical period and inconsistently calls the final projection 2070; the CSV and catalogue use 2080 (2071-2100). All six CSV period identifiers are preserved.",
    "All species columns are populated for every BGC unit. A risk rating does not establish occurrence, climatic suitability, regeneration success or a planting recommendation.",
    "BGC identifiers are BEC v11. Identifier equality alone does not verify boundary agreement with later map versions; site soil moisture must be assessed independently.",
    "The source is a climatological scenario table. Its 2020 projection covers 2011-2040 and is not a measurement of current drought conditions."
  ]
